{"1562060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DotStrike", "steam_appid": 1562060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562060/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.poster.avif?t=1656144516\" width=736 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562060/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.webm?t=1656144516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562060/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.mp4?t=1656144516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>DotStrike is a 3D online shooter in which alien invaders in the form of colored spheres fight each other in a seaport.<br><br>At the moment, two game modes are fully implemented: &quot;Team Confrontation&quot; and &quot;Confrontation&quot;.<br><br>In the &quot;Team Confrontation&quot; mode, players are divided into two teams: red and blue. The goal of each side is to score a given number of points faster than the rest of the team.<br><br>In the &quot;Confrontation&quot; mode, each player is for himself. The strongest alien will win this fight.<br><br><strong>The plot of the game</strong><br><br>All weapons have infinite ammo. This is all thanks to the alien technology of instant cartridge fabrication. For example, in an RPG, after a shot, a rocket grows in the muzzle of a grenade launcher.<br><br>But the aliens are not fighting alone. In addition to them, there is another side. It's called &quot;Unknown Power&quot;. Humans didn't just watch the alien conflict. From time to time, a bomber rises into the air and drops bombs on the warring aliens. In addition to people, there are natural disasters that also did not stand aside. This is a suddenly rising magma or a tornado that sucks everything in its